.TH "YAMLR-MIGRATE" "1" "March 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fBKubernetes API Migration (Alias for [upgrade](yamlr_upgrade.md))\fR
.PP
The \fBmigrate\fR command is an alias for \fByamlr upgrade\fR. It is used to transform manifests from deprecated or stale API versions to modern, stable ones.
.PP
.SH "USAGE"
.nf
.RS
yamlr migrate --to [VERSION] [PATH]...
.RE
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Performs the same structural reconstruction and API versioning upgrades as \fByamlr upgrade\fR.
.PP
For a full list of features, flags, and examples, please refer to the [yamlr upgrade](yamlr_upgrade.md) manual.
.PP
.SS "Options"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--dry-run\fR**: Show proposed changes without writing.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--diff\fR**: Show visual diff.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB-y\fR, \fB--yes\fR**: Auto-confirm changes.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--output FORMAT\fR**: Report format.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--kube-version <V>\fR**: Force a specific Kubernetes version (alias: **\fB--k8s-version <V>\fR**).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--max-depth <N>\fR**: Limit recursion depth.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--ext <list>\fR**: Extensions to scan (default: \fB.yaml,.yml\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--concurrency <N>\fR**: Number of parallel worker processes.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--verbose\fR**: Detailed execution logs.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB-s\fR, \fB--summary-only\fR**: Show aggregate stats.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB-p\fR, \fB--plain\fR**: ASCII-only output mode.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--identity-mode {infer,strict}\fR**: Identity detection style.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB-q\fR, \fB--quiet\fR**: Minimal output.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--strict\fR**: Enable strict schema validation.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--compact\fR**: Output with minimal whitespace.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--cpu-limit L\fR**: Override default CPU limit.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--mem-limit L\fR**: Override default Memory limit.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--namespace NS\fR**: Default namespace.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--health-threshold N\fR**: Min score to consider Healthy.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--enforce-limits\fR**: Auto-inject limits.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--enforce-probes\fR**: Auto-inject probes.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--enforce-namespace\fR**: Auto-inject namespace.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--fix-tags\fR**: Auto-remediate tags.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--harden\fR**: Apply hardening.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--stream-to FILE\fR**: Stream results.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--fail-on CHOICE\fR**: CI/CD Gate.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--check-deprecations\fR**: Check for deprecated APIs.
